<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-208] Broken test: GridCacheAbstractFullApiSelfTest.testNullInTx</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-208</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Affected tests classes: &lt;br/&gt;
GridCacheNearOnlyMultiNodeFullApiSelfTest&lt;br/&gt;
GridCacheNearOnlyMultiNodeP2PDisabledFullApiSelfTest&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Reason: transaction on near-only node is committed even after normal transaction was rolled back. That is, GCME.innerSet() for near entry is hit.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="12773449">IGNITE-208</key>
            <summary>Broken test: GridCacheAbstractFullApiSelfTest.testNullInTx</summary>
